{"1745280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magitek VR", "steam_appid": 1745280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magitek is a journey into the realm of elemental magic. With over 35 unique spells in 4 elements, your skills grow by practicing each class. Each class of magic operates by technique and skill. </p><br><strong>FIRE</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp and Intense movements create the Fire spells! From small fireballs to a scorching Inferno, and even flying with flame thrusters!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/4ed8b4d9b3d0210be28a502bb7433d1e.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/4ed8b4d9b3d0210be28a502bb7433d1e.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/4ed8b4d9b3d0210be28a502bb7433d1e.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>WATER</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, Flowing motion will master Water spells! Flood your opponent with water whips or freeze your enemy with petrifying Ice spells!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/a03a58bb9a34f2ee05fb8b1e7dff5c1c.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/a03a58bb9a34f2ee05fb8b1e7dff5c1c.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/a03a58bb9a34f2ee05fb8b1e7dff5c1c.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>EARTH</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strong &amp; rigid actions give earth spells their strength! Hurl boulders, Summon Rock armour, or erupt chunks of earth from the ground!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ddcbdb0eba0f78dc898184d702c37e7.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ddcbdb0eba0f78dc898184d702c37e7.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ddcbdb0eba0f78dc898184d702c37e7.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>AIR</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breezy, Effortless movements produce Air magic. Don't be fooled, air is powerful in a master’s arsenal, allowing you to dodge and fly around, as well as cut with powerful air-blades.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ccac06d1368fa6436762ea1cc6f3004.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ccac06d1368fa6436762ea1cc6f3004.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/0ccac06d1368fa6436762ea1cc6f3004.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><br><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 4 players in competitive arenas or unleash chaos together in the sandbox!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/c2145017963bf15b8db339aa4c5e30be.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/c2145017963bf15b8db339aa4c5e30be.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/c2145017963bf15b8db339aa4c5e30be.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ARENA</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in battles against waves of foes &amp; climb the leaderboards.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3d260898b137ccc948dbd604262db097.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3d260898b137ccc948dbd604262db097.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3d260898b137ccc948dbd604262db097.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>OPEN WORLD STORY</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic adventure in the world of Embra, where Dungeons, enemy encounters, the mysteries of Magitek await. </p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/9780f1869995d0ebbb71bfc2a43dacdc.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/9780f1869995d0ebbb71bfc2a43dacdc.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/9780f1869995d0ebbb71bfc2a43dacdc.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SANDBOX</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our sandbox mode provides the perfect playground for experimentation. Practice  your spells and test the systems of Magitek.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3f0ffbc1d05235163ab687f6c58699ef.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3f0ffbc1d05235163ab687f6c58699ef.webm?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/3f0ffbc1d05235163ab687f6c58699ef.mp4?t=1743164318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MORE FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grass burns, ice melts, water freezes and iron heats up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Enemies react to spells with physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and Items infused with elemental magic</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE ELEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magitek is a journey into the realm of elemental magic. With over 35 unique spells in 4 elements, your skills grow by practicing each class. Each class of magic operates by technique and skill. </p><br><strong>FIRE</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp and Intense movements create the Fire spells! From small fireballs to a scorching Inferno, and even flying with flame thrusters!</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745280/extras/4ed8b4d9b3d0210be28a502bb7433d1e.poster.avif?t=1743164318\" width=720 heig